OL,3,GNEWSATerrified woman found burglar
OL,4,Aeating tomato
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burglar who was found by a woman
OL,7,Feating a tomato in her kitchen has been
OL,8,Fjailed for more than two years.
OL,10,FStephen Young, 45, scaled a 5ft
OL,11,F(1.5m)-high fence and walked into his
OL,12,Fvictim's home while she was outside
OL,13,Fdoing chores on 12 May, Teesside Crown
OL,14,FCourt heard.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
