OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATerrified woman found burglar
OL,4,Aeating tomato
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe left when confronted by the woman
OL,7,Fwho said she was terrified by the
OL,8,Fencounter, which left her feeling
OL,9,F"shaken" and "unsafe in her own home".
OL,10,FShe was also now "scared" to do simple
OL,11,Ftasks such as go to her car or bring
OL,12,Fthe bins in for fear of someone coming
OL,13,Finto her home, the court heard.
OL,15,FYoung, from Hartlepool, who had a
OL,16,F"dismal" criminal record comprising
OL,17,Fdozens of offences, admitted burglary
OL,18,Fand was jailed for 876 days.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
